<%# A Turbo Frame's response (turbo-rails' frame layout, overridden): the
    page's own head and language, then the view without the shell. A frame
    visit that changes the URL (data-turbo-action, the card detail's ◀ ▶)
    has Turbo merge this head into the page's and set the page's language
    from it: with turbo-rails' bare layout the page would lose its title,
    viewport, language and View Transition meta. %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= I18n.locale %>">
  <head>
    <%= render "layouts/head" %>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%= yield %>
  </body>
</html>
